The one-dimensional bin packing instances in `falkenauer/` are those of
E. Falkenauer, "A hybrid grouping genetic algorithm for bin packing", Journal
of Heuristics 2 (1996) 5-30, as distributed in the OR-Library files
binpack1.txt to binpack8.txt and redistributed here under the MIT License of
OR-Library. `scripts/split_binpack.py` splits them into one file per instance
and scales the triplet class by ten so every size is an integer.

